  "task_id": 8392,
  "title": "The demise of guys?",
  "author": "Philip Zimbardo",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/philip_zimbardo_the_demise_of_guys",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T07:36:35.466697Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T07:36:35.466697Z",
  "lead_time": 40.303,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 10,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "I want us to reflect",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "403872273A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "So today, I want us to reflect on the demise of guys.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7BA5826711",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 9,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "flaming out",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0D9021762B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 43,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "wiping out",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "91A571CAB8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "Guys are flaming out academically; they're wiping out socially with girls and sexually with women.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C7932F2D12",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "Other than that, there's not much of a problem.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3648429C38",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "So what's the data?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1A003E5A5D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 31,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "amazing",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0535ACBB43",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "So the data on dropping out is amazing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AA2D8E873C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "Boys are 30 percent more likely than girls to drop out of school.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A287DFB95F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "In Canada, five boys drop out for every three girls.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DD648EB5A8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "Girls outperform boys now at every level, from elementary school to graduate school.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "815B454A22",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "There's a 10 percent differential between getting BA's and all graduate programs, with guys falling behind girls.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4089D0AD6A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "Two-thirds of all students in special ed. remedial programs are guys.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "306899ABBE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "as you all know",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0BFB1B0F4F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 30,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "five times more likely",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CD3843155D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 158,
        "text": "And as you all know, boys are five times more likely than girls to be labeled as having attention deficit disorder -- and therefore we drug them with Ritalin.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A5BE3C0D58",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "What's the evidence of wiping out?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "87EB111560",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "First, it's a new fear of intimacy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0410B237F6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 15,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "physical, emotional connection",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9686112A90",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 131,
        "endOffset": 179,
        "text": "ambiguous, contradictory, phosphorescent signals",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A8BF154DDB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 180,
        "text": "Intimacy means physical, emotional connection with somebody else -- and especially with somebody of the opposite sex who gives off ambiguous, contradictory, phosphorescent signals.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8D7DF21AA6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "And every year there's research done on self-reported shyness among college students.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "157D3EB969",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "And we're seeing a steady increase among males.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AF6C9FF092",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "And this is two kinds.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E822A85D7C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "It's a social awkwardness.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "13116FEEF8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "The old shyness was a fear of rejection.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2018FCAB60",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "It's a social awkwardness like you're a stranger in a foreign land.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6BD5186798",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "They don't know what to say, they don't know what to do, especially one-on-one [with the] opposite sex.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A9F55E873B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 90,
        "endOffset": 162,
        "text": "enable you to comfortably talk to somebody else, listen to somebody else",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4DD262B499",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 154,
        "text": "There's something I'm developing here called social intensity syndrome, which tries to account for why guys really prefer male bonding over female mating.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D22FDF9A79",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "It turns out, from earliest childhood, boys, and then men, prefer the company of guys -- physical company.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9AED57CC28",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 183,
        "text": "And there's actually a cortical arousal we're looking at, because guys have been with guys in teams, in clubs, in gangs, in fraternities, especially in the military, and then in pubs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9FDDC86179",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 98,
        "endOffset": 214,
        "text": "totally overdressed Aaron Rodgers of the Green Bay Packers, rather than Jennifer Lopez totally naked in the bedroom.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "555C615785",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 122,
        "text": "The problem is they now prefer [the] asynchronistic Internet world to the spontaneous interaction in social relationships.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4A32EB7A14",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "What are the causes?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "81DC878685",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "Well, it's an unintended consequence.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4475C9E131",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "I think it's excessive Internet use in general, excessive video gaming, excessive new access to pornography.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EA1E45D003",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "The problem is these are arousal addictions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AE0AB8F5BA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 16,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "you simply want more",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AAC3AFF919",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 19,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "you want different",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "30DA7E5636",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 7,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "you want more of the same -- different",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F97682338A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "So you need the novelty in order for the arousal to be sustained.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1E53C20906",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "And the problem is the industry is supplying it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "30163DBCE9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 130,
        "text": "Jane McGonigal told us last year that by the time a boy is 21, he's played 10,000 hours of video games, most of that in isolation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D354850A8F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "As you remember, Cindy Gallop said",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F3B3EE5AE7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "The average boy now watches 50 porn video clips a week.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F3E280F449",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 41,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "obviously",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F35B22BD4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "(Laughter) And the porn industry is the fastest growing industry in America -- 15 billion annually.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6772FC9000",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "For every 400 movies made in Hollywood, there are 11,000 now made porn videos.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C415E19824",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "So the effect, very quickly, is it's a new kind of arousal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DEBECB1E4E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 115,
        "text": "Boys' brains are being digitally rewired in a totally new way for change, novelty, excitement and constant arousal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "08386410DB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 19,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "totally out of sync in traditional classes, which are analog, static, interactively passive",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "395157B4D9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 66,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "build gradually and subtly",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
